    (OWASP A01 / A04 Insecure Design)
  * Templates / SSTI / XSS — Jinja2 `Environment(autoescape=False)` or
    `Template(user_string)` (template *source* from input is RCE, not
    just XSS — `{{ ().__class__.__mro__[1].__subclasses__() }}`), Mako
