    React-style dangerouslySetInnerHTML equivalents in server renders.
    (OWASP A03 Injection)
  * SQL / ORM injection — `cursor.execute(f"... {x} ...")`, `%`-format
    or `+` concat into any DB-API `execute`/`executemany`/`executescript`,
