    interpolation (placeholders cannot bind identifiers — use an
    allow-list). (OWASP A03 Injection)
  * NoSQL / query-language injection — pymongo `find(user_dict)` where
    the dict came straight from `request.json` (operator injection via
    `{"$ne": null}`, `{"$where": "..."}`), Elasticsearch query bodies
